Based on:        codex-first-customer-finder-skill
Original author: Francesco Mistero (Kappaemme)
Source:          https://github.com/Kappaemme-git/codex-first-customer-finder-skill
Original license: MIT

Adapted for the Russian-speaking (RU) market and ported to Claude Code by
Startend (https://startend.ru).

Summary of Startend's changes:
- Ported from a Codex skill to the Claude Code skill / plugin format.
- RU source map (vc.ru, Habr, Telegram, VK, Пикабу, hh.ru, отзовики,
  2ГИС/Яндекс.Карты, WB/Ozon) prioritised over global platforms.
- Russian-language query buckets instead of translated English.
- Import-substitution (импортозамещение) added as a primary RU timing trigger.
- 152-ФЗ-aligned privacy guidance.
- Russian outreach channels and house-style tone (на «Вы», без давления).
- Russian-language HTML report by default, with a `lang: en` toggle.

